WEBVTT

01:36.310 --> 01:41.100
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.380 --> 01:43.940
[Episode 25]

01:44.920 --> 01:45.979
Miss Tang is right.

01:46.759 --> 01:47.280
Qiu,

01:48.070 --> 01:49.130
about this matter,

01:49.509 --> 01:51.380
you should make it clear
in the first place.

01:51.380 --> 01:52.300
Got it?

01:52.870 --> 01:55.310
Qiushui, I'm back!

01:58.490 --> 01:59.390
Coming through!

01:59.390 --> 02:00.620
W-Who is this?

02:01.520 --> 02:02.250
What a crowd.

02:06.200 --> 02:08.840
I haven't formally introduced him
to all of you yet.

02:08.840 --> 02:10.470
This is Swordsman Sancai.

02:11.560 --> 02:12.120
Nice to meet you.

02:12.120 --> 02:14.030
Our plan wouldn't have been a success
without him.

02:14.030 --> 02:14.960
Nice to meet you.

02:18.360 --> 02:18.960
Sancai,

02:21.000 --> 02:22.600
I'm wondering what Yiren...

02:22.810 --> 02:23.670
He said...

02:26.150 --> 02:27.590
Shall we talk in private?

02:28.030 --> 02:29.430
That won't be necessary.

02:29.710 --> 02:31.510
These are close friends of mine.

02:31.910 --> 02:34.240
Yiren said he was too busy
to deal with you,

02:34.470 --> 02:37.000
and that h-he no longer saw you
as his brother.

02:45.840 --> 02:48.100
I meant to send Changge Sword back to him.

02:55.710 --> 02:56.910
This is infuriating.

04:08.580 --> 04:11.770
♪ The sea gives a laugh ♪

04:11.950 --> 04:15.020
♪ Waves are surging to the shores ♪

04:15.410 --> 04:21.880
♪ The roaring tides remind me
of life's ups and downs ♪

04:22.220 --> 04:25.670
♪ The heaven gives a laugh ♪

04:25.700 --> 04:28.600
♪ Adventures are like raging torrents ♪

04:29.030 --> 04:35.810
♪ Heaven knows who will win or lose ♪

04:33.270 --> 04:34.270
Big Brother!

04:34.750 --> 04:37.040
Heaven above, with the moon as witness,

04:37.360 --> 04:39.800
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood
will live and die together.

04:39.240 --> 04:42.560
♪ The mountain gives a laugh ♪

04:42.880 --> 04:45.780
♪ The rain patters afar amidst fog ♪

04:46.210 --> 04:49.710
♪ Worldly affairs entangle
in the swirling mass of seawater ♪

04:49.740 --> 04:52.790
♪ How many are revealed? ♪

04:53.110 --> 04:56.380
♪ The breeze gives a laugh ♪

04:56.400 --> 04:59.560
♪ It brings about melancholy ♪

04:59.920 --> 05:06.580
♪ Sunset glow sheds on the chest
that's full of ambitions ♪

05:37.659 --> 05:41.190
♪ The sea gives a laugh ♪

05:41.210 --> 05:44.120
♪ Waves are surging to the shores ♪

05:44.270 --> 05:51.120
♪ The roaring tides remind me
of life's ups and downs ♪

05:51.350 --> 05:54.680
♪ The heaven gives a laugh ♪

05:54.700 --> 05:57.980
♪ Adventures are like raging torrents ♪

05:58.210 --> 06:04.900
♪ Heaven knows who will win or lose ♪

06:04.970 --> 06:08.390
♪ The mountain gives a laugh ♪

06:08.530 --> 06:11.730
♪ The rain patters afar amidst fog ♪

06:11.940 --> 06:15.380
♪ Worldly affairs entangle
in the swirling mass of seawater ♪

06:15.410 --> 06:18.550
♪ How many are revealed? ♪

06:18.730 --> 06:22.190
♪ The people give a laugh ♪

06:22.290 --> 06:25.440
♪ Melancholy has long gone ♪

06:25.660 --> 06:32.980
♪ Smirks stay on the faces
of the ambitious ♪

07:09.800 --> 07:11.190
[Changge Sword]

07:22.470 --> 07:24.530
I'll go visit Yiren tomorrow morning

07:25.000 --> 07:26.530
and give him Changge Sword.

08:01.510 --> 08:02.640
How are your wounds?

08:03.070 --> 08:04.470
Is the medicine working?

08:07.360 --> 08:08.360
It's incredible.

08:09.190 --> 08:11.030
Thank you, Physician Tang.

08:50.030 --> 08:50.870
This dart

08:52.360 --> 08:55.720
accompanied me through
the first Tang Sect formation I tackled.

08:55.720 --> 08:57.450
I've always carried it with me,

08:57.550 --> 08:59.720
as if it's an amulet.

09:02.390 --> 09:05.030
Since you helped me

09:05.120 --> 09:07.920
secure my position as master
in the Insect Valley,

09:11.550 --> 09:12.950
I'd like you to have this.

09:19.840 --> 09:22.120
Maybe it can protect you.

09:23.000 --> 09:25.200
I just hope you won't get injured again.

09:48.000 --> 09:48.750
Thank you.

10:03.560 --> 10:05.290
[Xiao Residence]

10:05.370 --> 10:13.330
[Stay Vigilant]

10:23.930 --> 10:26.620
[Composure]

10:47.870 --> 10:48.550
Xueyu,

10:48.700 --> 10:49.750
you can't marry him.

10:49.750 --> 10:51.150
You don't like him at all.

10:51.510 --> 10:53.600
We watched Xueyu grow up.

10:53.600 --> 10:54.930
Under no circumstances

10:55.200 --> 10:56.860
should we put her in hot water.

10:57.320 --> 10:58.120
Right, Xueyu,

10:58.150 --> 10:59.320
your well-being

10:59.670 --> 11:01.470
should be held in your own hands.

11:01.710 --> 11:03.240
Don't let anyone force you.

11:09.320 --> 11:09.790
Xueyu,

11:10.600 --> 11:13.870
I promise to marry you off
to a man from a family

11:14.270 --> 11:16.720
that's as esteemed
and influential as Huanhua Sect.

11:16.720 --> 11:17.520
Rest assured.

12:06.390 --> 12:06.960
Father,

12:08.510 --> 12:09.200
Mother,

12:11.240 --> 12:13.000
I am getting married today.

12:15.960 --> 12:17.630
The Xiao family needs me now.

12:19.550 --> 12:21.680
I have to prioritize the greater good.

12:24.870 --> 12:26.670
You would support my choice,

12:28.640 --> 12:29.440
wouldn't you?

12:50.120 --> 12:50.910
Do you like it?

12:50.910 --> 12:51.550
Yes.

12:58.390 --> 12:59.120
Have a bite.

13:06.480 --> 13:07.630
Thank you, Xueyu.

13:29.320 --> 13:29.910
Yiren.

13:35.200 --> 13:36.000
How stunning.

13:36.670 --> 13:38.330
You look really pretty today.

13:40.910 --> 13:41.970
How's everything?

13:42.550 --> 13:43.510
Are you ready?

13:47.910 --> 13:49.150
I just recalled

13:49.670 --> 13:53.120
that some medicinal herbs
needed cutting and drying.

13:53.600 --> 13:56.060
I'm afraid
I'll have to trouble you for that.

13:59.240 --> 13:59.960
I will

14:01.440 --> 14:02.960
keep them safe for you.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.270
I remember when I was young,

14:07.720 --> 14:09.650
in the course of collecting herbs,

14:09.870 --> 14:11.730
I unfortunately fell off a cliff.

14:12.390 --> 14:14.240
But thankfully, you found me
before it was too late,

14:14.240 --> 14:15.770
so I could get medical help.

14:16.200 --> 14:17.080
Thereafter,

14:17.910 --> 14:20.240
whenever I had a need for medicinal herbs,

14:21.030 --> 14:24.150
you'd always notice it
and gather them for me.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.180
I'm very grateful for you.

14:28.030 --> 14:28.870
Xueyu,

14:29.960 --> 14:31.620
I don't think you're thanking

14:32.080 --> 14:33.120
the right person.

14:36.120 --> 14:37.000
It wasn't you?

14:40.870 --> 14:42.550
Back then, Qiushui frequented

14:42.550 --> 14:43.610
the back mountain,

14:44.200 --> 14:46.030
and often came back with injuries.

14:46.030 --> 14:49.160
Father always criticized him
for being a naughty child,

14:49.440 --> 14:51.240
and punished him several times.

14:55.080 --> 14:56.140
I never thought...

14:59.870 --> 15:00.960
it was Qiushui.

15:06.080 --> 15:07.030
Anyway, Xueyu,

15:09.960 --> 15:12.690
thank you
for all you've done for the Xiao family.

15:18.630 --> 15:20.690
Please take those words back, Yiren.

15:24.120 --> 15:25.250
I'm one of the Xiaos.

15:25.820 --> 15:28.130
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

15:27.030 --> 15:28.150
Father and Mother nurtured me

15:28.150 --> 15:32.860
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

15:28.910 --> 15:29.720
and loved me.

15:31.280 --> 15:33.510
Naturally, I'd like to defend
the Xiao family for them.

15:33.120 --> 15:35.470
♪ The wind blows ♪

15:35.500 --> 15:39.940
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

15:40.360 --> 15:40.960
I got it.

15:40.540 --> 15:42.990
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

15:43.010 --> 15:45.480
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

15:45.500 --> 15:48.610
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

15:49.300 --> 15:56.580
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

15:54.080 --> 15:55.270
Help!

15:59.390 --> 16:00.320
Don't be afraid.

16:00.610 --> 16:03.710
♪ Unspoken regret, shattered in the sand ♪

16:00.670 --> 16:01.200
There, there.

16:01.200 --> 16:02.030
You're safe now.

16:02.030 --> 16:02.960
Don't be scared.

16:03.840 --> 16:07.060
♪ Yesterday was a dream
difficult to find ♪

16:08.010 --> 16:11.290
♪ So far away in the blink of an eye ♪

16:10.000 --> 16:11.080
You must be Xueyu,

16:11.360 --> 16:14.350
♪ With weeds overgrown, where is home? ♪

16:12.150 --> 16:14.390
who Mother just gave birth to.

16:14.600 --> 16:16.070
Yes. I gave birth to her.

16:15.520 --> 16:18.720
♪ Owing love and hate;
favors and feuds rain down ♪

16:16.510 --> 16:18.640
She's the daughter of the Xiao family.

16:18.740 --> 16:22.470
♪ Too many apologies to be said ♪

16:20.910 --> 16:22.200
I have a sister now!

16:22.920 --> 16:25.810
♪ Missed in the intersection of time ♪

16:23.080 --> 16:23.910
Xueyu!

16:24.750 --> 16:26.240
Slow down, kids.

16:26.630 --> 16:28.870
♪ The inevitable destiny ♪

16:26.720 --> 16:29.030
Yiren! Yiren!

16:29.380 --> 16:31.360
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

16:30.320 --> 16:31.440
Did you miss me?

16:31.390 --> 16:35.440
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

16:32.550 --> 16:33.320
Did you miss me?

16:33.320 --> 16:33.840
Yes!

16:37.110 --> 16:39.780
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

16:39.800 --> 16:43.260
♪ It's a heartbreaking punishment ♪

16:43.860 --> 16:46.410
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

16:46.440 --> 16:50.680
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

16:49.790 --> 16:51.790
My Lady, it's about time.

16:51.160 --> 16:53.610
♪ The wind blows ♪

16:53.630 --> 16:58.550
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

16:58.670 --> 17:00.900
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

17:00.670 --> 17:01.360
Third Young Master.

17:01.070 --> 17:03.690
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

17:01.910 --> 17:02.550
Mr. Liang,

17:03.150 --> 17:04.200
what's the occasion?

17:03.720 --> 17:06.930
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

17:04.589 --> 17:07.250
Miss Xueyu is marrying
into the Nangong family.

17:07.470 --> 17:13.819
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

17:12.630 --> 17:15.490
[Huanhua Sect]

17:19.750 --> 17:20.270
Yiren!

17:25.440 --> 17:26.109
Yiren.

17:28.000 --> 17:29.270
Aren't you having
the best time of your life

17:29.270 --> 17:31.140
out there with the Shenzhou Brotherhood?

17:31.140 --> 17:32.470
What brings you back,

17:32.470 --> 17:33.270
big shot?

17:33.960 --> 17:35.930
Why are you making Xueyu
marry into the Nangong family?

17:35.930 --> 17:37.930
Whatever happens in the Xiao family

17:38.110 --> 17:39.680
is none of your business now, is it?

17:39.680 --> 17:41.070
As long as Xueyu is my sister,

17:41.070 --> 17:42.480
I'm entitled to an answer!

17:42.480 --> 17:43.240
Tell me,

17:43.880 --> 17:45.240
is someone forcing her?

17:45.440 --> 17:46.720
Stop being unreasonable!

17:46.720 --> 17:48.320
I'm not being unreasonable!

17:48.960 --> 17:50.090
Answer my question.

17:50.680 --> 17:52.810
Does Xueyu agree to this arrangement?

17:52.880 --> 17:53.940
Or is this marriage

17:54.310 --> 17:57.400
relevant to your attempts
to revitalize the family?

17:57.400 --> 17:58.240
Enough!

17:59.480 --> 18:01.110
As the eldest son of the Xiao family,

18:01.110 --> 18:02.480
I'm obligated to
plan for the family's future.

18:02.480 --> 18:04.480
How could you possibly understand?

18:04.830 --> 18:06.200
Being part of the Xiao family

18:06.200 --> 18:09.000
means offering support to the family
by all means!

18:10.790 --> 18:11.510
Yiren,

18:13.350 --> 18:15.480
the Xiao family has us three brothers.

18:16.590 --> 18:20.200
Why must you make Xueyu
sacrifice her lifelong happiness?

18:22.310 --> 18:24.480
Qiushui, stop pressing Yiren.

18:25.120 --> 18:27.160
Don't you see what state
our family is in right now?

18:27.160 --> 18:28.830
We've antagonized the Power Gang.

18:28.830 --> 18:31.160
All the sects in Jindu are shunning us.

18:31.550 --> 18:33.550
Even the young disciples in our sect

18:33.880 --> 18:35.480
have all turned to Tang Song.

18:35.680 --> 18:37.280
What option does Yiren have?

18:37.790 --> 18:40.520
Now, Xueyu gets to
marry into the Nangong family.

18:41.000 --> 18:43.730
That somewhat provides protection,
doesn't it?

18:47.270 --> 18:48.110
Protection?

18:50.270 --> 18:52.920
Kaiyan, Yiren,

18:53.680 --> 18:56.540
Tang Song and his fellows
have lost their standing.

18:56.920 --> 19:00.070
You don't need to fear Tang Sect anymore.

19:00.550 --> 19:01.270
Tang Sect?

19:02.160 --> 19:03.420
H-How do you know that?

19:04.590 --> 19:07.070
There's enmity
between Tang Sect and the Xiao family.

19:07.070 --> 19:07.830
What?

19:08.200 --> 19:09.260
Are you now engaged

19:09.880 --> 19:12.010
in some shady business with Tang Sect?

19:12.440 --> 19:13.510
I went to Tang Sect

19:15.030 --> 19:17.920
only to eliminate the villains
who colluded with the Power Gang

19:17.920 --> 19:20.120
to sabotage the martial sects in Jindu.

19:21.070 --> 19:22.530
It was all fair and square.

19:22.960 --> 19:24.360
I had no other intention.

19:25.440 --> 19:26.160
Yiren,

19:26.830 --> 19:28.480
can you be honest with me

19:29.480 --> 19:30.810
and answer my question?

19:31.310 --> 19:34.240
You messed with Tang Sect for others.

19:34.240 --> 19:34.790
What?

19:35.350 --> 19:36.790
You want me to praise you?

19:37.350 --> 19:41.000
I'm only worried if you've brought trouble
to the Xiao family again!

19:41.000 --> 19:43.310
Anyway, now,
what right do you have

19:43.310 --> 19:45.840
to interfere with
the Xiao family's affairs?

19:46.160 --> 19:46.960
I have not

19:48.110 --> 19:49.240
caused any trouble.

19:50.360 --> 19:51.840
Yiren, Qiushui.

19:56.310 --> 19:56.920
Xueyu.

19:58.920 --> 19:59.550
Qiushui,

20:00.440 --> 20:03.030
I'm glad you came back today.

20:12.920 --> 20:13.640
Xueyu,

20:15.110 --> 20:16.400
as long as you say no,

20:17.240 --> 20:19.040
I won't let anyone take you away.

20:22.270 --> 20:24.600
I'm willing to do this
for the Xiao family.

20:36.960 --> 20:37.680
Xueyu,

20:38.910 --> 20:39.720
this is wrong.

20:41.880 --> 20:44.640
The Nangong family
is wealthy and prestigious.

20:45.270 --> 20:46.530
In such chaotic times,

20:46.790 --> 20:48.650
who doesn't want to find shelter?

20:49.880 --> 20:52.920
This marriage will benefit
the Xiao family,

20:53.550 --> 20:54.790
as well as me.

20:55.880 --> 20:58.010
This would put our late parents' minds

20:59.070 --> 21:00.070
at rest.

21:03.200 --> 21:04.600
Stop the argument, guys.

21:36.120 --> 21:36.750
Let's go.

21:36.520 --> 21:38.930
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

21:39.700 --> 21:42.470
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

21:44.090 --> 21:47.250
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

21:47.600 --> 21:52.000
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

21:52.850 --> 21:56.250
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

21:56.630 --> 22:00.000
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

21:58.110 --> 21:59.000
Sister Xueyu.

21:59.590 --> 22:01.200
Whatever kind of partner
you want in the future,

22:00.930 --> 22:03.750
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

22:01.520 --> 22:02.850
you'll have my support.

22:03.780 --> 22:08.470
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

22:03.790 --> 22:06.190
Of course,
I want a heroic man of integrity,

22:06.510 --> 22:07.880
skilled in martial arts,

22:07.880 --> 22:09.070
decisive in his actions,

22:08.530 --> 22:10.530
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

22:09.400 --> 22:11.310
and above all, righteous,

22:10.550 --> 22:12.550
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

22:11.790 --> 22:14.030
conscientious, and chivalrous.

22:12.760 --> 22:15.500
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

22:16.090 --> 22:18.310
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

22:18.340 --> 22:23.690
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

22:24.530 --> 22:26.600
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

22:26.620 --> 22:28.620
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

22:28.670 --> 22:31.800
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

22:32.060 --> 22:34.370
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

22:34.390 --> 22:38.550
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

22:38.680 --> 22:41.080
Look who's disgracing the Xiao family now.

22:48.310 --> 22:49.110
Qiushui.

23:00.590 --> 23:01.520
Are you alright?

23:08.240 --> 23:08.920
Kaiyan,

23:10.480 --> 23:11.680
Xueyu doesn't want to

23:12.880 --> 23:15.340
marry into the Nangong family at all,
right?

23:16.430 --> 23:18.850
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

23:18.720 --> 23:19.650
But she did agree

23:19.710 --> 23:22.480
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

23:20.680 --> 23:22.540
to this arrangement, didn't she?

23:24.100 --> 23:27.260
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

23:27.600 --> 23:32.010
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

23:30.350 --> 23:31.640
Not a word she just said

23:32.850 --> 23:36.260
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

23:33.590 --> 23:35.030
was from her heart.

23:36.640 --> 23:40.010
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

23:37.270 --> 23:38.510
Xueyu is actually

23:40.160 --> 23:41.880
against this marriage.

23:40.940 --> 23:43.760
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

23:43.030 --> 23:43.680
That's the way

23:43.680 --> 23:45.640
Xiao Xueyu has always been, isn't it?

23:43.780 --> 23:48.480
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

23:47.000 --> 23:48.240
She's so considerate

23:48.530 --> 23:50.530
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

23:49.680 --> 23:50.750
that she often

23:50.560 --> 23:52.560
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

23:52.070 --> 23:53.200
neglects her own feelings.

23:52.770 --> 23:55.510
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

23:55.720 --> 23:56.640
But, Kaiyan,

23:56.100 --> 23:58.320
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

23:57.790 --> 23:59.310
you knew she'd opt for this choice.

23:58.350 --> 24:03.700
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

24:00.070 --> 24:01.720
Why didn't you try to stop Yiren?

24:01.720 --> 24:03.550
I did try to stop him.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.920
When Father and Mother were alive,

24:04.540 --> 24:06.600
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

24:06.630 --> 24:08.630
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

24:07.960 --> 24:09.200
they treated her

24:08.760 --> 24:11.900
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

24:09.830 --> 24:11.880
like their own daughter.

24:12.150 --> 24:14.460
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

24:12.720 --> 24:14.750
But now, they're gone,

24:14.550 --> 24:18.650
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

24:17.000 --> 24:19.310
and Xueyu is forced to get married.

24:20.530 --> 24:22.400
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

24:21.920 --> 24:24.110
Huanhua Sword Manual
is in the clutches of the Nangong family.

24:22.430 --> 24:24.430
♪ A few wild howls ♪

24:24.600 --> 24:27.660
♪ Come and go like flying birds ♪

24:24.640 --> 24:27.170
They insisted
Xueyu marry into their family,

24:27.480 --> 24:29.510
or they wouldn't return the manual to us.

24:28.070 --> 24:30.160
♪ Having witnessed countless miles
of sorrow and joy ♪

24:30.190 --> 24:35.290
♪  I've naturally gained courage
to be a hero ♪

24:30.880 --> 24:32.480
Yiren had to take this option

24:33.110 --> 24:35.310
to keep the manual from the wrong hands.

24:36.480 --> 24:38.550
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

24:38.570 --> 24:40.570
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

24:40.710 --> 24:43.840
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

24:44.090 --> 24:46.400
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

24:46.440 --> 24:50.540
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

24:52.450 --> 24:54.320
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

24:54.340 --> 24:56.340
♪ A few wild howls ♪

24:56.520 --> 24:59.570
♪ Come and go like flying birds ♪

24:59.990 --> 25:02.080
♪ Having witnessed countless miles
of sorrow and joy ♪

25:02.100 --> 25:07.200
♪  I've naturally gained courage
to be a hero ♪

25:04.850 --> 25:07.070
[Nangong Residence]

25:08.400 --> 25:10.310
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

25:10.340 --> 25:12.470
♪ Several rounds of turmoil ♪

25:12.490 --> 25:15.460
♪ Swaying in life-and-death dreams ♪

25:16.100 --> 25:18.100
♪ Shadows under countless lamps
over a thousand lifetimes ♪

25:18.120 --> 25:22.960
♪ Each leaves a single light
to shine through this night ♪

25:24.480 --> 25:26.480
♪ Smoke drifts, the road stretches far ♪

25:26.510 --> 25:28.480
♪ Love fades, people grow distant ♪

25:28.530 --> 25:30.530
♪ Flowers fall as dawn approaches ♪

25:30.560 --> 25:35.770
♪ Heart like fine rain,
drifting with the clouds ♪

25:40.880 --> 25:42.550
After you enter the Nangong household,

25:42.550 --> 25:44.010
take good care of yourself

25:44.030 --> 25:44.880
and keep well.

25:45.590 --> 25:46.920
If anything happens...

25:48.200 --> 25:50.160
Now that I'm joining another family,

25:50.160 --> 25:52.490
I'd hate to trouble the Xiao family again.

25:52.780 --> 25:53.910
Don't worry, Yiren.

27:17.720 --> 27:18.480
Who are you?

27:19.550 --> 27:20.610
What are you doing?

27:21.240 --> 27:22.160
Who am I?

27:22.930 --> 27:24.340
I'm your husband.

27:25.400 --> 27:28.240
I'm here to consummate our marriage,
of course.

27:28.620 --> 27:30.480
Come on, a drink for our union.

27:30.510 --> 27:31.440
Get away from me!

27:32.190 --> 27:33.540
The one I'm supposed to marry

27:33.540 --> 27:35.270
has always been Nangong Wushang.

27:35.270 --> 27:36.590
Who do you think you are?

27:36.590 --> 27:37.850
Don't you mess with me!

27:38.590 --> 27:40.440
Xiao Xueyu, listen up.

27:40.830 --> 27:42.390
I knew you wouldn't be submissive,

27:42.390 --> 27:44.470
so, earlier,
I lit incense to knock you out.

27:44.470 --> 27:45.860
Since you brother Xiao Yiren

27:45.860 --> 27:47.380
first came to discuss this marriage

27:47.380 --> 27:49.100
and signed an agreement with us,

27:49.100 --> 27:50.540
it has always been me, Nangong Han,

27:50.540 --> 27:53.350
who would marry you.

27:53.370 --> 27:55.310
[Marriage Agreement]

27:53.850 --> 27:55.450
Yiren wouldn't do this to me.

27:56.110 --> 27:57.910
He must've been deceived by you.

27:58.880 --> 28:00.810
Though the Xiao family has fallen,

28:01.300 --> 28:02.700
it still has been friends

28:03.450 --> 28:05.780
with the Nangong family for generations.

28:05.790 --> 28:07.650
How could you ambush us like that?

28:08.060 --> 28:08.780
Xueyu,

28:09.070 --> 28:10.870
come on, take a good look at this.

28:10.870 --> 28:13.330
Isn't it
Xiao Yiren's handwriting and seal?

28:13.790 --> 28:15.470
He wrote this with his own hand.

28:15.470 --> 28:17.200
You do recognize it, don't you?

28:19.280 --> 28:20.610
Try to come around to it.

28:20.810 --> 28:21.470
Stop acting

28:21.470 --> 28:23.270
like a paragon of chastity here.

28:24.200 --> 28:25.680
Think about the current condition

28:25.680 --> 28:27.070
the Xiao family is in.

28:27.230 --> 28:30.510
Your brother Xiao Yiren
doesn't even have the master's sword.

28:30.510 --> 28:31.940
It is actually an honor

28:31.960 --> 28:33.200
for you to marry me.

28:34.970 --> 28:35.930
I'd rather die

28:37.270 --> 28:38.510
than be your bride.

28:38.960 --> 28:39.830
Really?

28:41.160 --> 28:42.760
I'd like to see how this goes.

28:59.440 --> 29:00.720
Xueyu, let's leave.

29:01.400 --> 29:04.160
Nobody can force you to do anything.

29:06.720 --> 29:07.590
Remember this:

29:07.830 --> 29:10.830
I, Xiao Xueyu,
have nothing to do with you whatsoever.

29:14.080 --> 29:15.080
Changge Sword?

29:16.540 --> 29:17.500
From today on,

29:18.750 --> 29:21.750
if the Nangong family
dares to offend the Xiaos again,

29:21.920 --> 29:24.850
I'll show you no mercy
with Changge Sword in my hands.

29:44.720 --> 29:45.310
Let's go.

29:51.750 --> 29:53.550
Xiao Qiushui!

29:54.520 --> 29:57.110
[Liang Residence]

30:15.000 --> 30:16.130
Xueyu, don't worry.

30:16.230 --> 30:17.310
You're safe here.

30:17.960 --> 30:20.480
The Nangong family
wouldn't dare to mess with this place.

30:20.480 --> 30:21.400
As for Yiren,

30:22.640 --> 30:24.640
I'll try to talk some sense into him.

30:28.270 --> 30:29.920
I did agree to this marriage.

30:31.000 --> 30:33.660
I should repay Father and Mother
for raising me.

30:33.810 --> 30:35.720
I'd also like to contribute
as much as I can

30:35.720 --> 30:37.580
to revitalizing the Xiao family.

30:38.160 --> 30:39.560
It just didn't occur to me

30:40.000 --> 30:41.330
that Yiren would choose

30:42.590 --> 30:43.990
not to trust me in the end,

30:45.480 --> 30:48.080
despite our years' bond
as brother and sister.

30:49.270 --> 30:51.400
This whole thing was absurd in nature.

30:52.030 --> 30:52.640
Xueyu,

30:54.030 --> 30:57.090
you shouldn't have
forsaken your lifelong happiness,

30:57.640 --> 30:59.070
or put yourself in peril.

30:59.550 --> 31:01.440
Yiren's choice was even more ridiculous.

31:01.440 --> 31:04.020
How could he trade
a family member's well-being

31:04.020 --> 31:05.950
for the family's dignity and pride

31:06.110 --> 31:09.510
that Father and Mother
devoted their lives to safeguarding?

31:15.200 --> 31:17.130
On my way to the Nangong Residence,

31:18.790 --> 31:20.450
memories came flooding back.

31:23.030 --> 31:24.430
I recalled the first time

31:25.350 --> 31:27.550
that Father and Mother brought me home.

31:29.070 --> 31:30.400
The first thing you said

31:31.270 --> 31:33.000
already drove my worries away,

31:33.620 --> 31:37.000
and made me start thinking of myself
as part of the Xiao family.

31:37.000 --> 31:37.590
Qiushui,

31:39.680 --> 31:42.080
the family time we spent together
back then

31:42.960 --> 31:44.160
was truly wonderful.

31:49.270 --> 31:50.000
Xueyu,

31:51.110 --> 31:52.270
family members

31:54.200 --> 31:55.680
should never be bound
by the moral shackles

31:55.680 --> 31:57.160
of fulling filial duties.

31:57.680 --> 32:00.110
We should respect and understand
each other instead.

32:00.110 --> 32:02.510
Nobody in this world can,

32:03.310 --> 32:04.960
or has the right

32:05.550 --> 32:07.750
to make you do what you are reluctant to.

32:08.510 --> 32:12.170
And you, among all people,
should never think of self-sacrifice.

32:12.680 --> 32:14.140
You must cherish yourself

32:15.270 --> 32:17.000
and pursue what you truly want.

32:17.270 --> 32:18.400
Only that is the wish

32:18.960 --> 32:20.360
of all the family members

32:21.720 --> 32:24.050
who genuinely love you and care about you.

32:25.350 --> 32:26.200
I got it.

32:27.240 --> 32:27.970
Don't worry.

32:28.640 --> 32:29.270
Now that

32:29.720 --> 32:32.050
I've rescued you
from the Nangong family,

32:32.350 --> 32:35.200
I'll make sure
nobody ever hurts your feelings

32:35.400 --> 32:38.000
or forces you to do anything
against your will.

32:38.110 --> 32:39.350
If such a person does appear,

32:39.350 --> 32:41.510
I'll smash his head and break his legs.

32:46.000 --> 32:46.680
Qiushui,

32:48.350 --> 32:49.240
thank you.

32:50.960 --> 32:51.960
We're family.

32:52.510 --> 32:55.270
Save that sort of parlance for strangers.

32:59.720 --> 33:00.310
Xueyu,

33:01.350 --> 33:03.480
the Qu sisters reside here.

33:04.000 --> 33:06.480
You should talk with them

33:06.880 --> 33:08.350
and recuperate.

33:08.830 --> 33:11.030
I guess they're making soup for you now.

33:11.110 --> 33:12.640
I'll go see them.

33:13.510 --> 33:14.160
Qiushui.

33:17.750 --> 33:18.640
I'm not only

33:19.480 --> 33:21.210
thanking you for today's help,

33:21.830 --> 33:22.960
but also

33:23.200 --> 33:25.440
for saving my life when I fell off a cliff
during a trip

33:25.440 --> 33:26.640
of collecting herbs.

33:27.000 --> 33:30.000
It was you who kept bringing back
precious herbs for me.

33:30.000 --> 33:31.930
I'm truly grateful to you for that.

33:32.150 --> 33:33.240
We are family.

33:34.550 --> 33:37.680
No matter what danger
you may face in the future,

33:38.720 --> 33:41.180
I'll always be the first one
to come help you.

33:44.030 --> 33:44.590
Alright.

33:44.880 --> 33:45.480
Let's leave it there.

33:45.480 --> 33:47.680
Or you may hate me for being a nag.

33:49.510 --> 33:50.310
In my opinion,

33:50.720 --> 33:53.120
our eyes should always be
on the road ahead.

33:53.400 --> 33:56.000
We should stick together
as siblings forever.

33:58.000 --> 34:00.400
I was always the one
nagging at you in the past.

34:00.400 --> 34:02.960
Today, it is you
who is trying to enlighten me.

34:04.680 --> 34:05.270
Alright.

34:05.440 --> 34:07.000
Xueyu, I see you've lost a lot of weight.

34:07.000 --> 34:08.400
Let me go get soup for you.

34:55.150 --> 34:55.800
Tang Fang.

35:01.110 --> 35:02.510
Seeing how busy you were,

35:02.670 --> 35:04.530
I decided to wait for you outside.

35:13.070 --> 35:14.470
You're going somewhere?

35:24.670 --> 35:26.840
All women have similar struggles.

35:31.510 --> 35:32.970
You saved Xueyu from doom.

35:33.280 --> 35:34.480
I'm happy about that.

35:38.710 --> 35:41.480
When Xueyu was trapped
in the Nangong Residence,

35:42.510 --> 35:44.550
her situation was identical to mine

35:44.670 --> 35:45.670
back in Tang Sect.

35:47.550 --> 35:49.750
So, I'm glad that you went to her rescue.

35:52.280 --> 35:54.710
That's why she's safe and sound now.

36:01.110 --> 36:01.920
Thank you.

36:09.800 --> 36:11.730
I received a letter from my father,

36:13.030 --> 36:15.440
saying that they are in trouble

36:15.440 --> 36:16.700
and expecting my help.

36:17.550 --> 36:19.280
Since your wounds have healed,

36:19.880 --> 36:22.320
I think it's time I went home.

36:25.000 --> 36:26.460
Are the problems serious?

36:29.230 --> 36:30.690
No, just trivial matters.

36:31.070 --> 36:32.070
Once I solve them,

36:32.670 --> 36:33.800
I'll come back here.

36:42.000 --> 36:42.710
Okay.

36:43.630 --> 36:45.830
Then we'll all go to Emei Sect together.

36:47.960 --> 36:49.030
If we can figure out

36:49.030 --> 36:50.920
the secrets of the Voidheart Codex,

36:50.920 --> 36:53.400
there will be a cure for your father.

37:35.920 --> 37:36.650
Big Brother!

37:38.550 --> 37:39.750
Just as you expected,

37:39.800 --> 37:41.620
Nangong Wushang and his brothers

37:41.620 --> 37:43.620
are making a scene in the Xiao Villa.

37:45.230 --> 37:46.960
The Xiao family is obviously disrespectful

37:46.960 --> 37:48.220
to the Nangong family.

37:48.510 --> 37:49.280
Mr. Nangong,

37:50.070 --> 37:51.130
what are you doing?

37:51.510 --> 37:52.570
Stop playing dumb!

37:52.960 --> 37:53.630
Xiao Yiren,

37:54.280 --> 37:56.030
our family treated you
with absolute decency.

37:56.030 --> 37:58.150
We arranged the betrothal gifts
and the wedding as you asked.

37:58.150 --> 38:00.230
Before the reception was over,

38:00.590 --> 38:03.390
my brother's bride
was taken away by Xiao Qiushui.

38:03.480 --> 38:05.080
Did you mean to humiliate us?

38:06.760 --> 38:09.760
Wasn't Xueyu supposed to
marry you, Nangong Wushang?

38:10.320 --> 38:11.480
What exactly happened?

38:11.480 --> 38:13.150
Xiao Qiushui wasn't able to do
what you said.

38:13.150 --> 38:15.810
Besides,
he's no longer part of the Xiao family.

38:16.070 --> 38:16.710
He's not?

38:18.360 --> 38:20.060
Xiao Qiushui was holding Changge Sword,

38:20.060 --> 38:22.660
which belongs to
the master of the Xiao family.

38:22.960 --> 38:23.760
What?

38:24.430 --> 38:26.300
Qiushui has Changge Sword?

38:26.710 --> 38:27.280
Yiren,

38:28.280 --> 38:29.340
what is that about?

38:29.840 --> 38:32.150
Xiao Yiren, since you can't
make decisions,

38:32.150 --> 38:33.800
why pretend to be the head of the family?

38:33.800 --> 38:35.610
I'd like to cancel this marriage now.

38:35.610 --> 38:37.830
As long as the Xiao family
returns all the betrothal gifts

38:37.830 --> 38:41.160
and compensates us for our losses
that amount to 5,000 taels,

38:41.160 --> 38:42.760
we'll call it even.

38:42.950 --> 38:43.910
Nangongs,

38:44.350 --> 38:45.870
how shameless of you.

38:46.190 --> 38:48.000
How are we supposed to
get you 5,000 taels?

38:48.000 --> 38:49.800
If necessary,
we'll even pull down your villa

38:49.800 --> 38:50.580
and take the pieces away!

38:50.580 --> 38:51.310
How dare you!

38:52.070 --> 38:54.270
Your aggression is not to be tolerated!

38:54.670 --> 38:56.000
Fight those who resist,

38:56.190 --> 38:57.920
with no regard for casualties!

39:10.230 --> 39:11.030
Qiushui?

39:14.710 --> 39:15.670
Xiao Qiushui?

39:16.670 --> 39:18.340
For taking advantage of the vulnerable,

39:18.340 --> 39:20.870
the Nangong family
doesn't deserve respect.

39:21.110 --> 39:23.280
How dare you mess with us
in our own place?

39:23.280 --> 39:25.610
Now I announce, the marriage is canceled.

39:26.150 --> 39:29.610
The betrothal gifts will be returned
to you tomorrow morning.

39:31.000 --> 39:31.590
Let's go!

39:37.800 --> 39:38.480
Qiushui.

39:42.440 --> 39:44.510
You've got your martial strength back?

39:44.510 --> 39:46.570
Look how impressive your skills are.

39:48.710 --> 39:50.310
You're a better fighter now.

39:50.360 --> 39:51.960
A worse troublemaker, too!

39:59.030 --> 40:00.360
If you're talking about

40:01.480 --> 40:04.400
me taking Xueyu away
from the Nangong Residence,

40:05.440 --> 40:06.840
then I did nothing wrong.

40:07.190 --> 40:07.800
Yiren,

40:08.710 --> 40:10.310
you're the one who did wrong.

40:13.320 --> 40:14.120
Let me ask you.

40:14.710 --> 40:17.710
Do you really have Changge Sword?

40:18.320 --> 40:19.510
When I got hold of it,

40:20.480 --> 40:22.230
I meant to bring it back to you.

40:23.480 --> 40:26.630
But now, as I see it,
it's completely unnecessary.

40:28.280 --> 40:30.010
Every member of the Xiao family

40:30.800 --> 40:34.360
has the duty to revitalize the clan.

40:36.230 --> 40:37.360
But I disagree

40:38.480 --> 40:40.110
with your approach, Yiren.

40:44.510 --> 40:45.630
Xiao Qiushui!

41:07.630 --> 41:11.960
Qiushui!

41:20.630 --> 41:22.440
Qiushui...

41:26.360 --> 41:27.590
It really hurts.

41:33.190 --> 41:34.000
How are you?

41:34.630 --> 41:35.360
I'm in pain.

41:36.400 --> 41:37.800
You reckless fool

41:37.920 --> 41:39.320
with terrible lightness skills.

41:39.320 --> 41:40.230
How silly.

41:40.510 --> 41:41.480
Next time, I...

41:42.920 --> 41:44.390
Qiushui, look!

41:49.280 --> 41:50.110
I found this falconry whistle

41:50.110 --> 41:52.360
in a hidden compartment
in the Sword King's bedroom.
